# move-dumper

TypeScript tool (not scaffolded yet). Simulates match play between skill levels and dumps labelled positions from [foochu/bgweb-api](https://github.com/foochu/bgweb-api).

- Loop, pairing, levels: `docs/domain/move-dumper.md`. Match math: `docs/domain/match-play.md`.
- Convert at the boundary per `docs/domain/gnubg.md`. Store our JSON + evals only. Rank chosen checker plays by mover MWC.
- On-disk batches: `docs/domain/dump-format.md` under `move-dumper/dumps/` (`manifest.json` + `records.jsonl.gz` + `replay/*.sgf`).
- Do not call the gnubg CLI for labels. Never commit `dumps/`. Fixtures in `move-dumper/fixtures/` may be committed.
- Do not add `package.json` or a TS toolchain unless the user asks.
